  "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/ai-and-ml/llms/how-to-evaluate-llms-before-production/",
  "sourceTitle": "How to evaluate LLMs before production",
  "sourceBodyHash": "e7522ae18a0ead6a9786fbf1358f7ef13820f73417c3d72d433625d42ca1212e",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-12T16:18:04.308174Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T09:08:30.237872Z",
  "totalBlocks": 121,
  "translatedBlocks": 121,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f800048da73a1bb",
      "translationZh": "一个语言模型可以在干净的基准测试中表现出色，却仍然难以应对生产环境中真正重要的情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abea0c727fbbd507",
      "translationZh": "在为基于 LLM 的系统构建原型时，基准测试和经过精心整理的数据集很有用。它们帮助团队比较模型、测试初始提示词，并判断一个想法在技术上是否可行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "703214b835b655b6",
      "translationZh": "但随着系统逐渐接近投入生产，评估问题也会发生变化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c270a0181968ef14",
      "translationZh": "真实输入往往存在歧义。标签可能不一致。重要的上下文可能缺失或被截断。评估集可能无法反映生产环境中的数据分布。在基准测试中很少出现的边界情况，可能成为常见的故障来源。即使离线指标有所改善，这些结果也未必能直接转化为生产环境中的实际表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ee9891ddcd9003b",
      "translationZh": "我们在评估一个旨在减少 GitHub secret scanning 误报的基于 LLM 的系统时，遇到了这些挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15781abca50f2e67",
      "translationZh": "机密扫描会识别可能已被提交到代码仓库中的令牌、密钥等凭据。由于某些候选字符串看起来像机密信息，却并不代表真实凭据，开发者可能会花时间调查那些无需采取补救措施的告警。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5faa9fa9f18941cc",
      "translationZh": "我们需要了解的不是 LLM 能否正确地对一个字符串进行分类，而是系统能否减少噪声告警，同时保留足够的召回率，以确保安全工作流的安全性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f269794d34d93c8",
      "translationZh": "在这篇文章中，我们分享了帮助我们从有前景的原型结果走向生产应用的实践经验。这些经验广泛适用于代码分析、开发者工具、安全、数据分析以及其他生产工作流中的 LLM 驱动系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fcc87b059c36af65",
      "translationZh": "1. 从产品决策入手，而不是模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03f482c45ff49e5b",
      "translationZh": "当 LLM 系统的表现不符合预期时，人们的第一反应往往是调整其技术组件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "498324ae259e36ed",
      "translationZh": "团队可能会重写提示词、添加上下文、引入额外的推理步骤、调整周边处理流水线，或更换模型。在进行任何这些改动之前，他们应先明确这项评估旨在支持什么决策。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3213de10ee4b179c",
      "translationZh": "在我们的秘密信息扫描工作中，我们提出了这样一个问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4abb0ce81c73381",
      "translationZh": "系统能否减少误报，同时保持足够的召回率，以确保在生产环境的安全工作流中安全运行？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03da918533c3f3b3",
      "translationZh": "要回答这个问题，团队必须确定哪些错误可以接受、哪些指标应主导产品决策，以及哪些防护指标必须保持在各自规定的阈值范围内。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "283c48a8d2fe0771",
      "translationZh": "在秘密信息扫描中，错误地屏蔽一个真实凭据，其后果可能比让开发者多审查一条告警更严重。因此，我们并未将精确率和召回率视为同等且可相互替代的指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9fe9cf4eaafb6b4",
      "translationZh": "我们的首要目标是减少误报并提高精确率。召回率则作为安全约束：只有当召回率的任何下降都处于预先定义的可接受范围内时，实验才能继续推进。这让我们有了明确的方法来评估各项权衡。我们选择了在满足召回率要求和运行防护约束的前提下，误报减少幅度最大的配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7ab24fbc916cb66",
      "translationZh": "我们将评估标准分为三个层级：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0e2a92020899d33",
      "translationZh": "这一层衡量了我们试图提升的用户收益：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2e8874e109d7f944",
      "translationZh": "减少误报",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a3e0e8c4cc8c0cc",
      "translationZh": "这一层防止表面上的改进引入不可接受的安全风险：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0c6ff3f7536f1b27",
      "translationZh": "运行护栏",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "902cfac513b48295",
      "translationZh": "这些标准决定了结果在实际部署中是否可行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d65aa3ca76c211aa",
      "translationZh": "生产环境兼容性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1394836fd7373799",
      "translationZh": "这一区分避免了我们将所有指标视为可以互换。减少误报却显著降低召回率的变更，并不一定就是改进。提升质量却使系统过慢、成本过高或难以集成的变更，也同样如此。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0377517961823afc",
      "translationZh": "考虑两个假设的实验结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8efb8dc5872d8341",
      "translationZh": "实验 精确率 召回率 延迟 决策",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "124baf99d1691d0a",
      "translationZh": "低于安全护栏阈值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "acf15bc662744163",
      "translationZh": "仍在护栏范围内",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0da298a628f09696",
      "translationZh": "如果只看精确率，实验 A 可能显得更出色。实验 B 更符合产品目标，因为它在不违反召回率护栏约束的情况下改善了开发者体验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f834ceef530fbb1d",
      "translationZh": "在评估 LLM 系统之前，先确定对用户而言什么才算成功，以及系统必须遵守哪些护栏约束。我们希望生成能够支持产品决策的证据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "84f96745db863475",
      "translationZh": "2. 将离线评估视为集成测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "883ebf8b44e8c6f5",
      "translationZh": "基于 LLM 的系统在首次成功通过评估后仍会持续变化，因此评估不应是一次性的工作。团队会修改提示词、采用新模型、改变输入和上下文的构建方式，并完善周边的业务逻辑。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8717f5f7030d304",
      "translationZh": "这些改动中的任何一项都可能改善系统、导致性能退化，或使系统行为发生意想不到的变化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c650bd0aa275be81",
      "translationZh": "因此，我们将离线评估视为类似于端到端集成测试的过程。每当我们对提示词、模型、输入构建方式或更广泛的系统逻辑做出实质性改动时，都会重新运行评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6df9521cb1700b3",
      "translationZh": "评估还需要具有足够的可重复性，以便将每次的新结果与已知基线进行比较。每次运行时，我们都会记录提示词、模型、数据集版本和系统配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51967265597578d5",
      "translationZh": "这样就能回答以下问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "13213953f890ff1c",
      "translationZh": "新提示词是否在不降低召回率的情况下提高了精确率？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8951920edd5debd4",
      "translationZh": "模型升级是否对整个数据集都有帮助，还是只对某些类别有效？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d2bd802326fc803c",
      "translationZh": "对输入或上下文的改动是否在修复一种错误模式的同时引入了另一种？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ee88f7a595315bd",
      "translationZh": "对外围逻辑的改动是否持续改善了结果，还是仅仅改变了错误出现的位置？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10b5b3c1a5cbcccc",
      "translationZh": "如果没有这种严谨做法，团队很容易将不同条件下生成的结果进行比较，并将改进归因于错误的变更。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d2bf94376cea73ae",
      "translationZh": "每次只改变一个主要变量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7033f98710ed7f0e",
      "translationZh": "仅有可重复性还不够。实验设计还需要确保结果的成因清晰明确。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62196057560186f0",
      "translationZh": "我们每次只改变一个主要变量，并将每次运行的结果与已知基线进行比较。例如，我们先分别评估提示词修订和模型升级，再测试两者同时变更的效果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee143cf8f2b80592",
      "translationZh": "这一点很重要，因为即使是细微的提示词变更，也可能改变模型行为，而模型升级则可能影响质量、成本、延迟或输出一致性。如果在同一个实验中同时改变两者，我们就无法知道究竟是哪一项导致了改进或退步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea84467c1b435843",
      "translationZh": "我们像对待代码一样对待提示词和评估配置。我们对它们进行版本管理，记录变更内容，确保先前的配置可以复现，并支持回滚。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "232a59071eea3675",
      "translationZh": "运行 ID 提示词版本 模型版本 精确率 召回率 延迟 备注",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0675b229b99adb3d",
      "translationZh": "上方评估运行跟踪表中的数值是假设的，仅用于说明如何跟踪和比较各次评估运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "393724b6d942bb33",
      "translationZh": "定期测试模型升级",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35bd1c785124faa0",
      "translationZh": "当 LLM 系统表现不佳时，开发者往往会在提示词中添加更多指令。有时这会有所帮助，但并非总是如此。例如，提示词可能承载了由模型本身带来的复杂性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11e3b077541cb6b0",
      "translationZh": "更强的模型配合更简单的提示词，其表现可能优于经过大量调优的旧模型。更简单的提示词也更容易理解、测试和维护。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43c948a2ef579899",
      "translationZh": "模型升级仍然需要仔细评估。新模型可能在某一类别中提升表现，却在其他方面引入性能退化。它还可能影响成本、延迟、输出格式，或与现有流水线的兼容性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2af1d79d44b08cfe",
      "translationZh": "评估流程应当成本足够低、可重复性足够高，使测试新模型成为常规操作。对提示词、模型或流水线的任何实质性改动，都应在进入生产环境之前经过离线评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "58a3bae22bd2cbef",
      "translationZh": "3. 让离线评估贴近生产环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ed12a2b8b5d3853",
      "translationZh": "只有当离线评估与系统将在生产环境中执行的任务相似时，它才有用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad80282a55f025e2",
      "translationZh": "在秘密信息扫描工作流中，模型很少只评估一个干净、孤立的值。它可能需要结合周围的代码以及其他信息来评估某个特定的候选项，而这些信息可能与任务相关、并不完整，或可能造成干扰。这些信息的呈现方式不同，可能会显著影响结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9dfc2cd68c199b2",
      "translationZh": "因此，我们的离线评估需要保留生产环境中任务的重要特征，包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8f760e9bdfed9d06",
      "translationZh": "被评估的候选项",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7a3d88e7a522f9fc",
      "translationZh": "模型可获取的周边上下文",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e9aa31794ed57ec8",
      "translationZh": "相关的辅助信息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1dfd9ab888567527",
      "translationZh": "输入的格式和约束方式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c25179d9104eafaa",
      "translationZh": "围绕模型的更广泛的系统逻辑",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69534a1ac4fe96ef",
      "translationZh": "即使细微的差异也可能使结果产生偏差。更干净的数据集可能会排除存在歧义的案例、提供更完整的上下文，或移除可能分散模型注意力的邻近值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f69d0705ce09bf22",
      "translationZh": "来看一个简化的例子：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b99dde8d0b42fb2",
      "translationZh": "假设 candidate_value 是系统应当评估的值。模型却可能转而关注 example_token，因为它的变量名看起来与安全更相关，从而针对错误的值给出一个看似合理的解释。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38f5b654166e64b0",
      "translationZh": "当评估样例中只有一个明显的候选值时，这类失败很容易被忽略。之所以能发现这一问题，是因为离线评估保留了真实机密扫描工作流程中的一些歧义和干扰因素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83e2690bab979909",
      "translationZh": "离线流水线越接近生产流水线，评估就越有用。当两者存在差异时，较高的离线得分可能仅仅说明评估所面对的问题比实际部署时的问题更简单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "819e3afbcf541f12",
      "translationZh": "4. 将生产环境标签视为信号，而非不容置疑的真相",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e49b24cbfa1c9146",
      "translationZh": "生产数据可以让评估更具代表性，但其标签往往记录的是工作流程的结果，而非可靠的真实标签。例如，一条被忽略或已解决的机密扫描告警，并不一定就是误报。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e35f82292c61cce0",
      "translationZh": "开发者可能会因以下原因将告警标记为已解决：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "91246efd58b2721f",
      "translationZh": "凭据已轮换",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "17796194a75de8f5",
      "translationZh": "需要清除该告警，以解除工作流程的阻塞",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fc0391e66f94c21c",
      "translationZh": "该告警被错误分类",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa111dd1d696a310",
      "translationZh": "这些结果在产品数据中可能看起来相似，却代表着不同的真实状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da87ddda589faad5",
      "translationZh": "在使用生产环境标签之前，请先问：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0632e5f371058113",
      "translationZh": "这个标签是如何创建的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "27ff25694b7e1409",
      "translationZh": "它是否与评估试图回答的问题相符？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d3802a7c36a84a22",
      "translationZh": "不同的工作流结果是否被归入了同一类别？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1c4ede88b5f0f78",
      "translationZh": "对于重要或存在歧义的子集，你可能需要进行人工审核。你的目标不是消除每一个不完善的标签，而是确保评估数据足够准确，能够支持当前要做出的决策。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5ceac34a27e0c4f3",
      "translationZh": "5. 使用合成数据集和开放数据集来填补覆盖缺口",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "772b3e43b57c65a1",
      "translationZh": "具有代表性的生产数据在开发早期可能数量有限、涉及敏感信息，或无法获取。合成样例、学术基准和开放数据集可以帮助开发者启动评估并扩大覆盖范围，但这些样例应作为接近生产环境的数据的补充，而不是替代品。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c231d9132ad390f5",
      "translationZh": "在此前提下，对于罕见或难以收集的测试案例，例如有歧义的输入、缺失的上下文、不常见的格式，以及代表性不足的失败模式，合成样例可以极大地帮助填补测试空白。例如，一份凭据字符串列表可以测试模型是否识别常见格式，但无法全面评估模型如何在真实代码中对候选项进行推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e6b26e8349c7e5d",
      "translationZh": "我们调整了外部样例，使其符合我们的任务，并复核了与产品定义不一致的标签。我们还利用贴近实际的失败模式，创建了有针对性的合成案例，涉及附近类似凭据的值、测试代码、占位符、间接引用和缺失的上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "92a816be01baa69a",
      "translationZh": "6. 利用错误分析发现汇总指标掩盖的问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b19f02b15ef16231",
      "translationZh": "汇总指标告诉你系统整体上是否有所改善。错误分析则告诉你接下来该改什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33d3499ec641e311",
      "translationZh": "更高的精确率得分并不能揭示剩余错误究竟来自有歧义的输入、不佳的提示词表述、缺失的上下文、带有噪声的标签，还是覆盖范围狭窄的数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "960c6998fadaa4f7",
      "translationZh": "要理解这些问题，就要检查失败案例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73af2104230dc8d3",
      "translationZh": "我们审查了假阳性和假阴性样本，并按其可能的来源进行分组：模型、提示词、输入、处理流水线、数据集或标签。反复出现的问题包括前文已经讨论过的几种情况，例如对错误的候选项进行推理、上下文缺失，以及标签与评估定义不一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b02f432c5078f3e3",
      "translationZh": "每个类别都指向不同的应对措施。围绕错误的值进行推理，说明应关注提示词或输入的表述方式；缺少证据，说明应关注上下文构建；标签不正确，则需要清理数据。反复出现的领域特定歧义，可能表明需要更明确的产品政策，或一个专门的评估类别。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "041d79c4ea225bc0",
      "translationZh": "手动审查数十个或数百个示例需要时间，但往往能带来更快的进展。一旦明确了反复出现的失败模式，团队就可以进行有针对性的调整，并衡量调整是否解决了问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3067e895ae9d767d",
      "translationZh": "对于每个错误，一个有用的问题是：这次失败源于模型、提示词、输入、处理流水线、数据集，还是标签？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8024af7eb55f9a7c",
      "translationZh": "这种分类能将模糊的质量问题转化为具体的工程任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eb66b871d27d9b69",
      "translationZh": "7. 使用大语言模型作为评判者，让人工审查聚焦重点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed423c9fb99bea94",
      "translationZh": "手动审查每个评估示例可能难以扩展。让大语言模型充当评判者，可以通过对明确的案例进行分类、识别可能被错误标注的示例，以及优先安排人工审查有歧义的案例，来减轻这一负担。由于评判者也可能犯错，或因错误的理由而与另一个模型得出一致结论，因此应将其输出视为另一个预测，而非真实标准答案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b11a00e9130b3053",
      "translationZh": "一种更安全的做法是使用评判者进行分流：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d85863ac624e955d",
      "translationZh": "自动处理明确、低风险的案例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7942866228fb0fe5",
      "translationZh": "将低置信度、存在冲突或影响重大的案例转交给人工审核人员。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "073f3a3be2cb2f7b",
      "translationZh": "定期抽查高置信度案例，以检查是否存在系统性错误。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38a8c2032fd36db0",
      "translationZh": "跟踪评判器、被评估系统与人工审核人员之间的分歧。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eafeb08b2d33ef54",
      "translationZh": "像对待其他模型组件一样，对评判器提示词进行版本管理和评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99da0d290a4f0ea8",
      "translationZh": "以这种方式使用评判器，可以让人工注意力集中在那些审核最有可能改变结果的案例上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e98d8bf2e4f8efb0",
      "translationZh": "8. 秘密信息扫描带给我们的启示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d331f4258b26a0c4",
      "translationZh": "我们的目标是在一个对安全高度敏感的工作流中减少误报，同时保持召回率。离线评估为我们提供了一种可控的方式，让我们能够在开始在线实验之前，比较提示词、模型、输入和流水线的变更。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41628544789cd4bb",
      "translationZh": "通过反复评估和有针对性的错误分析，我们在所评估的离线数据集上将误报减少了 95%，同时将召回率保持在我们设定的护栏范围内。更重要的是，我们了解了这一结果是如何产生的：评估更贴近生产环境中的任务，变更以可复现的基线为参照进行衡量，而仍然存在的失败模式也得到了记录。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec8526678ed589d0",
      "translationZh": "离线评估并未证明系统在每一种生产场景下会如何表现。它提供了足够的结构化证据，支持在明确了解风险和防护措施的前提下进入在线实验阶段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "267be71a75b5137e",
      "translationZh": "检查清单：将 LLM 系统推向生产环境之前",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d473ca0cc6d7b97",
      "translationZh": "使用这份检查清单，评估你的评估工作是否提供了足够的证据来推动系统进入下一阶段。逐项检查各个部分，确认目标、数据、实验以及尚存的生产环境风险都已得到清晰理解。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5c585075701c796c",
      "translationZh": "产品决策和主要成功指标是否明确？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cafa5cb54b3fcb7f",
      "translationZh": "是否已定义安全和运行方面的防护措施？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ad31aa5f0e65bf3b",
      "translationZh": "评估数据是否与生产环境中的工作流程相似，并包含困难案例？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6744e21b3d20eeed",
      "translationZh": "我们是否了解标签是如何创建的，以及哪些地方需要人工审核？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ad2ad8f19970c45d",
      "translationZh": "是否已记录提示词、模型、数据集和流水线的版本？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e3007a16002628ef",
      "translationZh": "是否已将重大变更单独隔离，并与已知基线进行比较？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf44277a5c57dfcc",
      "translationZh": "错误分析与生产就绪性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e4e4784f74308549",
      "translationZh": "是否已按类别审查误报和漏报？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e36914b55e53b68",
      "translationZh": "我们能否重新运行评估，并解释离线结果在哪些方面可能与生产环境中的结果不同？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c67d42d14f0883e1",
